              439.53497314453125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                15
              ]
            ],
            "text": "llamado “el hombre de jesed”.[31 ]En otras palabras, la persona despierta el alba, es ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                5.829999923706055
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif-SemiboldItali",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
