              334.2280578613281
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "ellos el concepto de despertar del sueño espiritual, la capacidad de encontrar ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.692901611328125,
              336.26806640625,
              445.0689697265625,
              346.2280578613281
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "los puntos buenos en los momentos más oscuros, debido a la especial influencia ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.692901611328125,
              348.3780517578125,
              445.07000732421875,
              358.2380676269531
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "que existe a medianoche. El despertar a medianoche permite que los piadosos y ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.692901611328125,
              360.3780517578125,
              445.074951171875,
              370.2280578613281
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "temerosos de Dios hagan descender constantemente sobre ellos esta capacidad ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.692901611328125,
              372.0697937011719,
              445.1568603515625,
              382.39013671875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                8
              ]
            ],
            "text": "- es decir, toda vez que las klipot quieran hundirlos en una constricción y en ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifMediumItalic",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.69291687011719,
              382.0865478515625,
              445.16387939453125,
              394.3062438964844
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                9
              ]
            ],
            "text": "un sueño muy poderoso. Aunque Sitra Ájara intente vencerlos, jas ve-shalom, y ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif-SemiboldItali",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifMediumItalic",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.69293212890625,
              396.0880432128906,
              445.1571044921875,
              406.2380676269531
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                10
              ]
            ],
            "text": "pese al sufrimiento que deban enfrentar, siempre serán capaces de despertar de ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.69294738769531,
              408.0880432128906,
              445.1669616699219,
              418.2280578613281
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                11
              ]
            ],
            "text": "la constricción más tremenda a través del despertar en jatzot - es decir, debido ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif-SemiboldItali",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.692962646484375,
              420.0880432128906,
              340.2030334472656,
              430.2380676269531
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                12
              ]
            ],
            "text": "al poco de bien que cada uno aún encuentra en sí mismo.",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          56.69293212890625,
          434.92205810546875,
          445.1669616699219,
          565.06201171875
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09296417236328,
              434.92205810546875,
              445.1660461425781,
              445.06207275390625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                13
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Y así, en Egipto, Moshé no sabía todavía cómo determinar apropiadamente ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.692962646484375,
              446.92205810546875,
              445.149169921875,
              457.06207275390625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                14
              ]
            ],
            "text": "el momento de la medianoche pues ello era antes de la Entrega de la Torá ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.692962646484375,
              459.1020812988281,
              445.16497802734375,
              469.06207275390625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                15
              ]
            ],
            "text": "y no hubo un itaruta delatata, un despertar de energía espiritual proveniente ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif-SemiboldItali",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.69293212890625,
              470.9219665527344,
              445.1531066894531,
              481.0719909667969
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                16
              ]
            ],
            "text": "del pueblo judío abajo.[147]Aún no había tantos Tzadikim que se levantaran a ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                5.829999923706055
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              482.9219665527344,
              445.1490783691406,
              493.0719909667969
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                17
              ]
            ],
            "text": "medianoche y se dedicaran al estudio de la Torá, dado que ello fue antes de ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              494.9219665527344,
              445.16314697265625,
              505.0619812011719
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                18
              ]
            ],
            "text": "la Entrega de la Torá y por lo tanto era difícil determinar el punto preciso de ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              506.9219970703125,
              445.1559753417969,
              517.072021484375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                19
              ]
            ],
            "text": "la medianoche. Esto es verdad incluso de acuerdo a la opinión de que Moshé ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              518.9219970703125,
              445.1669616699219,
              529.06201171875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                20
              ]
            ],
            "text": "sí sabía cuál era el momento exacto de la medianoche. Moshé sabía, pero no les ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifStd-Semibold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
