              242.4921417236328,
              603.4066162109375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                16
              ]
            ],
            "text": "un objeto dado a un Tzadik para que efectúe un tikún y una ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
                7.5
              ],
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
                7.5
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85963439941406,
              605.5804443359375,
              242.51242065429688,
              612.4066162109375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                17
              ]
            ],
            "text": "salvación en aras del dador. Es una antigua costumbre el que ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
                7.5
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85963439941406,
              613.10546875,
              242.49969482421875,
              621.407958984375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                18
              ]
            ],
            "text": "el judío que experimente algún infortunio o difi cultad le de ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
                7.5
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.86039733886719,
              623.5804443359375,
              242.49290466308594,
              630.4066162109375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                5,
                19
              ]
            ],
            "text": "tzedaka a un Tzadik y le pida que ore por él. El pidion sirve ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
                7.5
              ],
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
                7.5
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
