              470.57373046875,
              441.25921630859375,
              477.39990234375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "de dinero, ver §1 y nota 9 más arriba. En el LM I, 180, el ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
                7.5
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              252.61642456054688,
              479.570068359375,
              441.26531982421875,
              486.39990234375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Rebe Najmán demuestra que el dinero posee una misma ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
                7.5
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              252.61642456054688,
              488.57373046875,
              441.2585144042969,
              495.38525390625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "raíz espiritual que los dinim. Por lo tanto, cuando la persona ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
                7.5
              ],
              [
                "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
                7.5
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
