        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09298706054688,
              351.6719665527344,
              414.1769104003906,
              361.1919860839844
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "El Rabí Natán retorna ahora a desarrollar la idea de que el estudiar Torá y ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "Optima",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09298706054688,
              363.6719665527344,
              410.742919921875,
              373.2419738769531
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "el servir a HaShem por la noche fortalece la plegaria a la mañana siguiente.",
            "styles": [
              [
                "Optima",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          56.6929931640625,
          381.36199951171875,
          445.1650390625,
          415.3219909667969
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09298706054688,
              381.36199951171875,
              445.1650390625,
              391.3219909667969
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Y levantarse a medianoche también lleva a mejorar la plegaria. Pues el ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              393.47198486328125,
              445.1650390625,
              403.3219909667969
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "principal objetivo de despertar el alba es mejorar nuestra plegaria, para tener ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              405.1619873046875,
              433.3288879394531,
              415.3219909667969
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "el mérito de orar por la mañana con una gran kavaná y con todo el corazón.",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif-SemiboldItali",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          56.6929931640625,
          420.0159912109375,
          445.1778869628906,
          562.156005859375
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09297180175781,
              420.0159912109375,
              445.071044921875,
              430.156005859375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Al despertar el alba, dedicándose en ese momento de la noche al estudio ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              432.0159912109375,
              445.1609802246094,
              442.166015625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "de la Torá y al servicio a HaShem, se desbloquean los senderos del intelecto y ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              443.9960021972656,
              445.1650085449219,
              454.156005859375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "uno se hace digno de eliminar las preguntas sobre la emuná y extirpar la herejía. ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif-SemiboldItali",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              456.0159912109375,
              445.1552429199219,
              466.166015625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Luego de ello uno merece saber plenamente que “la tierra entera está llena de ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              467.95196533203125,
              445.16497802734375,
              478.23419189453125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Su gloria”, que es la intención de la glosa del Shuljan Aruj, donde indica que“He ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifMediumItalic",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              480.0159912109375,
              445.1651306152344,
              490.156005859375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                8
              ]
            ],
            "text": "puesto a HaShem siempre delante de mí”. Y entonces, mediante el saber con ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              492.0159912109375,
              445.1529846191406,
              502.166015625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                9
              ]
            ],
            "text": "todo el corazón que “la tierra entera está llena de Su gloria”, merecemos orar ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              503.9960021972656,
              445.1690673828125,
              514.166015625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                10
              ]
            ],
            "text": "con una gran kavaná. Pues una vez que la persona es consciente que HaShem ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif-SemiboldItali",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              514.2160034179688,
              445.1778869628906,
              526.166015625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                11
              ]
            ],
            "text": "se encuentra sobre ella en el momento en que está orando y que Él oye, escucha ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              528.0159912109375,
              445.16796875,
              538.166015625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                12
              ]
            ],
            "text": "y está atento a cada expresión que surge de su boca, de seguro podrá orar con ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              540.0159912109375,
              445.1620178222656,
              550.166015625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                13
              ]
            ],
            "text": "un gran fervor y será muy cuidadosa de centrar su atención en lo que está ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.6929931640625,
              552.0159912109375,
              242.6110382080078,
              562.156005859375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                14
              ]
            ],
            "text": "diciendo, como se explicó más arriba.",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
