      {
        "index": 7,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          56.93536376953125,
          372.282958984375,
          445.4136047363281,
          466.2111511230469
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.33540344238281,
              372.282958984375,
              445.40838623046875,
              382.1429748535156
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "De modo que no debemos compararnos con esos grandes Tzadikim, ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.93536376953125,
              383.9929504394531,
              445.3183898925781,
              394.1429748535156
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "quienes poseen un espíritu superior y diferente. Esto es especialmente así dado ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.93536376953125,
              396.1729736328125,
              445.3173522949219,
              406.1329650878906
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "que ellos sólo bebían antes de orar pues estaban muy enfermos y así se veían ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.935394287109375,
              407.9929504394531,
              445.4064025878906,
              418.1429748535156
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "compelidos a hacerlo. Más aún, no debemos permitirnos esto dado que la mayor ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.9354248046875,
              419.9929504394531,
              445.4073486328125,
              430.1329650878906
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "parte de los Tzadikim no lo hacen. Nuestro santo Rebe, el Rebe Najmán, contó ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.9354248046875,
              431.9929504394531,
              445.4136047363281,
              442.1429748535156
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "que él nunca bebió ni siquiera agua antes de la plegaria de la mañana. Aunque ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.9354248046875,
              443.9929504394531,
              445.4075012207031,
              454.1429748535156
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "de acuerdo a la ley del Shuljan Aruj está permitido beber agua, él ni siquiera lo ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif-SemiboldItali",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.93544006347656,
              455.9289245605469,
              192.63084411621094,
              466.2111511230469
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "hizo antes de orar Shajarit.[69]",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                5.829999923706055
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerifMediumItalic",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 8,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          56.9354248046875,
          470.82794189453125,
          445.40740966796875,
          502.59796142578125
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.33540344238281,
              470.82794189453125,
              445.3164978027344,
              480.97796630859375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Volvamos a nuestro tema. En base a lo que se dijo más arriba sobre orar con ",
            "styles": [
              [
                "ITCStoneSerif-SemiBold",
                10.0
              ],
              [
                "StoneSerif",
                10.0
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
